<title>USA: U.S. corn, wheat and soybean export estimates.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn, wheat and soybean export estimates.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the weekly U.S. grain and soybean export inspections due from the USDA today at 1000 CST are as follows, in millions of bushels.</p>
<p>		     Range	    week ago</p>
<p> Soybeans     20.0 to 27.0	20.998</p>
<p> All wheat     8.0 to 13.0	12.038</p>
<p> Corn	   30.0 to 39.0	37.967</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
